### **⚡ QUICK SYNC METHODS**

#### **Method 1: One-Command Chat Sync (Primary)**
```javascript
// Step 1: Get current tasks
mcp_archon_list_tasks({
    project_id: "d010ff76-0202-48e4-8362-40c45e9de39a",
    include_closed: false,
    per_page: 50
});

// Step 2: Transform and sync (use result from step 1)
todo_write({
    merge: false,
    todos: [/* transformed_task_array */]
});
```

