### **📊 TRANSFORMATION LOGIC**

#### **Status Mapping Rules:**
| Archon Status | Chat Status | Description |
|---------------|-------------|-------------|
| `todo` | `pending` | Not yet started |
| `doing` | `in_progress` | Currently active |
| `review` | `in_progress` | Under review (still active) |
| `done` | `completed` | Finished |

#### **Priority Detection Logic:**
```javascript
function getPriorityEmoji(title, description) {
    const text = `${title} ${description}`.toUpperCase();
    if (text.includes('CRITICAL')) return '🚨';
    if (text.includes('HIGH')) return '⚡';
    if (text.includes('MEDIUM')) return '📊';
    return '📝'; // Default/Low priority
}
```

#### **Content Formatting:**
```javascript
function formatTodoContent(task) {
    const emoji = getPriorityEmoji(task.title, task.description);
    const briefDesc = task.description.substring(0, 80) + "...";
    const assignee = task.assignee !== "User" ? ` (${task.assignee})` : "";
    return `${emoji} ${task.title} - ${briefDesc}${assignee}`;
}
```

